│ # Marketing Campaign Brief: AI-Powered Meeting Summarizer                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                                             │
│ ## Market Insights                                                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                                             │
│ Busy professionals and executives struggle with time management, often spending countless hours in meetings. Many find it challenging to sift through notes and recordings  │
